+```bash
+adb push frida-server-17.18.0-android-arm64 /data/local/tmp/frida-server
+adb shell "su -c 'chmod 755 /data/local/tmp/frida-server'"
+adb shell "su -c '/data/local/tmp/frida-server &'"
