+           func#129 @0x11deb0  <- func#99 (anti-Frida), func#225 (maps integrity)
+           func#198 @0x143694  <- func#162 (anti-Frida b64), func#200 (anti-hook)
+           func#213 @0x151e68  <- func#60 (the 179,828-byte Xposed/Riru scanner)
